5.4.15|user_forward_files|reviewed|low|
5.4.16|user_netrc_files|reviewed|low|
5.4.17|user_rhosts_files|reviewed|medium|
5.4.18|user_groups|reviewed|medium|
5.4.19|user_home_dirs|reviewed|medium|
5.4.20|user_home_perm|750|medium|fixes/cis-permissions-fix.sh --home-perm
5.4.21|user_home_owner|self|medium|fixes/cis-permissions-fix.sh --home-owner
5.4.22|user_home_group|self|medium|fixes/cis-permissions-fix.sh --home-group
5.4.23|user_home_world_writable|none|medium|fixes/cis-permissions-fix.sh --home-world-writable
5.4.24|user_home_suid|reviewed|low|
5.4.25|user_home_sgid|reviewed|low|

